  "limitations": [
    "Original vTaskDelete and prvDeleteTCB execute in an emulator over authored kernel state, TCBs and lists, reusing vTaskEnterCritical/ExitCritical, uxListRemove, vListInsertEnd and prvResetNextTaskUnblockTime as guarded original code; mret is not executed.",
    "configASSERT, the critical-section diagnostic body, vPortYield, newlib _reclaim_reent and vPortFree are supplied. Assert and yield are harness stops; the deferred idle-task cleanup that actually frees a self-deleted task is not executed here.",
    "The heap free, reent reclamation, idle-task termination sweep (prvCheckTasksWaitingTermination) and live rescheduling after a yield remain unproved on hardware."
